  "question": {
    "text": "There are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;men and two women participating in a chess tournament. Each participant plays two games with every other participant. If the number of games played by the men between themselves exceeds the number of games played between the men and the women by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>84</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>12</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>7</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>9</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, number of men is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and number of women is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Since each participants competes two games&nbsp;with each other, Hence count of men Vs men total number of game plays <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>count of men Vs women&nbsp;total number of game&nbsp;plays <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi></math>.</p><p>As per given condition in question,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>"
  }
